window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v26-079-c2413c7eec199ea4.json"]={sha256:"c2413c7eec199ea4173a04eac1fb0d6b1bd9f23168ad3db78ee8afe24b8e5644",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-fb2abdf307947209","url":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/governance/policy/concepts/exemption-structure","title":"Azure Policy exemption structure","titleEn":"Azure Policy exemption structure","publisher":"Microsoft","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-079","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-079","related":[{"id":"security-v26-080","referenceUrls":["https://www.checkov.io/7.Scan%20Examples/Terraform%20Plan%20Scanning.html"],"title":"Checkov：Terraform計畫與變更風險差異","titleEn":"Checkov: Terraform plans and change-risk diffs","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付40資源三狀態表、6份豁免理由、範圍反例及到期處置紀錄。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver forty resource statuses, six exemption rationales, scope counterexamples and expiry actions.","difference":"把原始設定、解析後計畫與政策結果連結，針對新增、更新、刪除分別審查。","differenceEn":"Link source configuration, resolved plan and policy results, reviewing creates, updates and deletes separately.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["真實符合率=符合資源/適用資源；豁免率另算，不把豁免自動變成控制已實作。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 40個適用資源中30個符合、6個有效豁免、4個不符合。 符合率30/40=75%，豁免率6/40=15%，未符合且未豁免10%。","新增缺口=計畫後違規集合減既有違規集合；總違規數不變也可能掩蓋新風險。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 基線有8個違規，計畫修復3個但新增4個；所有識別均為本機合成資源。 計畫後8−3+4=9個，淨增1，但新增缺口是4個。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Actual conformity is compliant resources divided by applicable resources; exemptions do not mean the control is implemented. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. Forty applicable resources include thirty compliant, six valid exemptions and four noncompliant. Conformity is 75%, exemptions 15%, and noncompliant unexempted resources 10%.","New gaps are post-plan violations absent from the baseline; unchanged total counts can conceal newly introduced risk. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. The baseline has eight violations; a plan fixes three but introduces four on synthetic local resource identities. Post-plan total=8−3+4=9, a net increase of one but four newly introduced gaps.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v26-089","referenceUrls":["https://volatility3.readthedocs.io/en/stable/"],"title":"Volatility 3：記憶體視圖差異與證據限制","titleEn":"Volatility 3: memory-view differences and evidence limits","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付40資源三狀態表、6份豁免理由、範圍反例及到期處置紀錄。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver forty resource statuses, six exemption rationales, scope counterexamples and expiry actions.","difference":"比較不同列舉方式的程序識別、建立時間與父子關係，將差異視為調查起點而非直接定罪。","differenceEn":"Compare process identity, creation time and parentage across enumeration methods, treating differences as leads rather than verdicts.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["真實符合率=符合資源/適用資源；豁免率另算，不把豁免自動變成控制已實作。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 40個適用資源中30個符合、6個有效豁免、4個不符合。 符合率30/40=75%，豁免率6/40=15%，未符合且未豁免10%。","對稱差=集合A大小+集合B大小−2×交集；差異也可能來自結束程序、損壞或解析限制。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 合成視圖A有40個程序，B有44個，共同38個；以PID加建立時間作身分鍵。 聯集46個，對稱差40+44−2×38=8個。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Actual conformity is compliant resources divided by applicable resources; exemptions do not mean the control is implemented. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. Forty applicable resources include thirty compliant, six valid exemptions and four noncompliant. Conformity is 75%, exemptions 15%, and noncompliant unexempted resources 10%.","Symmetric difference=|A|+|B|−2|intersection|; differences may reflect exited processes, corruption or parsing limits. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. Synthetic view A contains forty processes and B forty-four, sharing thirty-eight; identity is PID plus creation time. The union has forty-six entries and the symmetric difference is eight.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-05ba73697627695a","url":"https://www.checkov.io/7.Scan%20Examples/Terraform%20Plan%20Scanning.html","title":"Checkov Terraform plan scanning","titleEn":"Checkov Terraform plan scanning","publisher":"Checkov","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-81775cce479382d9","url":"https://volatility3.readthedocs.io/en/stable/","title":"Volatility 3 documentation","titleEn":"Volatility 3 documentation","publisher":"Volatility Foundation","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
